                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I came to this game looking to goon originally, however it far surpassed my expectations. The CGs were gorgeous, the story was scarily rooted in reality, and most of all both characters have an arc. This was a semi-short VN, myself having finished in 3.6 hours, but throughout those three and a half hours, I was encapsulated the entire time. Throughout the game, the topic of incest was taken seriously and with care. The girls dont treat it like a fetish at all, starting out as rejecting it. Overtime, they cant resist. However, before this could even occur, Iris (MC), is constantly telling herself no, this is wrong. Later on, once its confirmed they're sisters, Zoey does the same.\n\nThroughout the game, the fact that theyre sisters was clearly not the  main incentivizing factor to their love and yearning. Instead, it was how each interaction shapes the view on one another. Zoeys original wish to hate Iris when they met comes to mind, and how Iris constantly proved herself to be better than Zoey wanted. The amount of character development (and I suppose mild character regression in the form of Iris' grade performance tanking) had me on the edge of my seat throughout.\n\nSPOILER WARNING\nThe story, as stated, was more realistic than other games featuring this taboo, even down to consequences. At one part of the game, the sisters are caught making out, causing the prof who caught them to prepare to call the police. My one critique was how easily the father accepted them, however even then it was a wonderful story.\n\n\nTL;DR\nInteresting story, characters, beautiful cgs, shorter side, 8.9/10",
